        "TileImage": "$($repository 98a0df23-42b6-47ae-a491-4aa86e0c6bbf).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, agent.\r\rThis fun contrast has some slight rootypoo. You must bring NOTHING! NOTHING at all. Just you and your attached big one. Starting in the mansion basement, the first kill item is in the starting room and each weapon needed for each target can be found in the room where the previous target was killed.\r\rHopefully you don&apos;t get lost too bad in this shitshow called Santa Fortuna. Best of luck?",
